From: mkinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:27:18 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(build): report each catalog case with a time budget

Give every example case separate regeneration and rebuild results.
Keep the existing assertions and print each case's elapsed time.
Pin independent failures, test registration, and the time budget.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2857
